tes","item":"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates"}]},{"@type":["TechArticle","APIReference"],"@id":"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#apireference","headline":"Orderbook Updates","name":"Orderbook Updates","description":"Real-time orderbook price level changes. Provides incremental updates to maintain a live orderbook. Requirements: - Authentication required - Market specification required: - Use market_ticker (string) for a single market - Use market_tickers (array of strings) for multiple markets - market_id/market_ids are not supported for this channel - Sends orderbook_snapshot first, then incremental orderbook_delta updates - Supports update_subscription with add_markets / delete_markets / get_snapshot actions - get_snapshot returns an orderbook_snapshot for the requested market_tickers without modifying the subscription Use case: Building and maintaining a real-time orderbook","url":"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#webpage"},"dateModified":"2026-05-06T00:22:32.387Z","publisher":{"@id":"https://docs.kalshi.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://docs.kalshi.com#website"}}]}</script><script>document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-page-mode', "none");</script><span class="fixed inset-0 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark -z-10 pointer-events-none" id="background-color"></span><style data-custom-css-index="0" data-custom-css-path="style.css">/* Keep /changelog in the Changelog tab without rendering a redundant sidebar row. */
#navigation-items li[id="/changelog"] {
  display: none;
}

.docs-home-hero {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 24rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: -1px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.docs-home-hero-bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  height: 24rem;
  background-size: 100%;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

.docs-home-hero-bg-light {
  background-image: url("https://mintlify-assets.b-cdn.net/kalshi-bg.svg");
}

.docs-home-hero-bg-dark {
  display: none;
  background-image: url("https://mintlify-assets.b-cdn.net/kalshi-dark-bg.svg");
}

.dark .docs-home-hero-bg-light {
  display: none;
}

.dark .docs-home-hero-bg-dark {
  display: block;
}

.docs-home-hero-content {
  position: absolute;
  width: min(45rem, calc(100% - 2rem));
  padding: 0 1rem;
  text-align: center;
  color: #000;
}

.dark .docs-home-hero-content {
  color: #fff;
}

.docs-home-hero-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
  font-size: 36px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 44px;
}

.docs-home-hero-subtitle {
  margin-top: 1rem;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 400;
  opacity: 0.6;
}

.docs-home-hero-agreement {
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.docs-home-hero-agreement span {
  opacity: 0.6;
}

.docs-home-hero-link {
  color: #00B67A;
  text-decoration: underline;
}

html.dark .docs-home-hero-link {
  color: #00DD94;
}

.docs-home-content {
  max-width: 70rem;
  margin: 4rem auto 8rem;
  padding: 0 1.25rem;
}

.docs-home-section-title {
  margin-top: 3.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 650;
  line-height: 2.25rem;
}

.docs-home-section-title:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}
