t.svg?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=koRHzlv9fsyF-jSm\u0026q=85\u0026s=bac849e081bbb1881bb945ea3e0464a8\"}},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com#website\",\"name\":\"API Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates\",\"name\":\"Orderbook Updates\",\"description\":\"Real-time orderbook price level changes. Provides incremental updates to maintain a live orderbook. Requirements: - Authentication required - Market specification required: - Use market_ticker (string) for a single market - Use market_tickers (array of strings) for multiple markets - market_id/market_ids are not supported for this channel - Sends orderbook_snapshot first, then incremental orderbook_delta updates - Supports update_subscription with add_markets / delete_markets / get_snapshot actions - get_snapshot returns an orderbook_snapshot for the requested market_tickers without modifying the subscription Use case: Building and maintaining a real-time orderbook\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-06T00:22:32.387Z\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#breadcrumb\"}},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"WebSockets\",\"item\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Orderbook Updates\",\"item\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates\"}]},{\"@type\":[\"TechArticle\",\"APIReference\"],\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#apireference\",\"headline\":\"Orderbook Updates\",\"name\":\"Orderbook Updates\",\"description\":\"Real-time orderbook price level changes. Provides incremental updates to maintain a live orderbook. Requirements: - Authentication required - Market specification required: - Use market_ticker (string) for a single market - Use market_tickers (array of strings) for multiple markets - market_id/market_ids are not supported for this channel - Sends orderbook_snapshot first, then incremental orderbook_delta updates - Supports update_subscription with add_markets / delete_markets / get_snapshot actions - get_snapshot returns an orderbook_snapshot for the requested market_tickers without modifying the subscription Use case: Building and maintaining a real-time orderbook\",\"url\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/websockets/orderbook-updates#webpage\"},\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-06T00:22:32.387Z\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com/#organization\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://docs.kalshi.com#website\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5a:[\"$\",\"$L5b\",null,{\"pageMetadata\":\"$54:props:pageMetadata\",\"mdxExtracts\":\"$57:props:value:mdxExtracts\",\"openApiReferenceData\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$5d\"}}],\"$L5e\",\"$L5f\",\"$L60\",\"$L61\",\"$L62\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"63:I[228341,[\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/7578c347033fb4c7.js?dpl=dpl_WUrXqCd5nPFDSzoTYvx4Wt8NzcVY\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/b664fc8bb1e7ab0d.js?dpl=dpl_WUrXqCd5nPFDSzoTYvx4Wt8NzcVY\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/e820c38ea057e1be.js?dpl=dpl_WUrXqCd5nPFDSzoTYvx4Wt8NzcVY\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/e00dc38219d4677d.js?dpl=dpl_WUrXqCd5nPFDSzoTYvx4Wt8NzcVY\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/761250e423ee7acf.js?dpl=dpl_WUrXqCd5nPFDSzoTYvx4Wt8NzcVY\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/8048dcef7298cf99